*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 0402CT-1N2
* Inductance = 1.2nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-26GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 0402CT-1N2 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.02588pF Ind=1.2nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=50
+ R2=0.035
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.00000554
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 0402CT-1N2

